@DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5118

### 1. Start digital onboarding session
POST {{DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/onboarding/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "fullName": "Alice Smith",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "channel": 0
}

###

### 2. Submit identity document (replace {id} with session ID from step 1)
POST {{DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/onboarding/sessions/{id}/document
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": 0,
  "documentNumber": "P1234567",
  "issuingCountry": "AL",
  "expiryDate": "2030-01-01",
  "documentImageBase64": "BASE64_ENCODED_DOCUMENT_IMAGE"
}

###

### 3. Submit biometric (selfie + liveness)
POST {{DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/onboarding/sessions/{id}/biometric
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "selfieImageBase64": "BASE64_ENCODED_SELFIE_IMAGE",
  "fingerprintProvided": false
}

###

### 4. Get session status and full result
GET {{DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/onboarding/sessions/{id}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Start in-store KYC session (staff-initiated)
POST {{DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instore/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afb7",
  "fullName": "Bob Jones",
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "staffId": "STAFF001",
  "locationCode": "TIR-01"
}

###

### 6. In-store scan: document + selfie in one call
POST {{DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/instore/sessions/{id}/scan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": 2,
  "documentNumber": "N1234567",
  "issuingCountry": "AL",
  "expiryDate": "2030-06-01",
  "documentImageBase64": "BASE64_ENCODED_DOCUMENT_IMAGE",
  "selfieImageBase64": "BASE64_ENCODED_SELFIE_IMAGE"
}

###

### 7. Create a digital signature request (requires an approved session)
POST {{DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/signatures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "SESSION_ID_FROM_STEP_1",
  "documentName": "Customer Agreement",
  "documentContent": "This agreement is between One Albania and the customer.",
  "level": 1,
  "signatories": ["alice@example.com", "officer@onealb.com"],
  "expiryDays": 7
}

###

### 8. Sign the document (repeat with each signatory)
POST {{DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/signatures/{id}/sign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "signatory": "alice@example.com",
  "documentContent": "This agreement is between One Albania and the customer."
}

###

### 9. Validate completed signature
GET {{DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/signatures/{id}/validate
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Get audit trail for a session
GET {{DigitalOnBoardingV2.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audit/{sessionId}
Accept: application/json

###

